{"availability":"available","full":"EVEglyphDesign/lenexa-city-center-commons","name":"lenexa-city-center-commons","description":"A place for neighbors to compare notes on Lenexa City Center — a neutral, geofenced, publish-only community map. No accounts, no analytics, no authority is ever notified.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-26T04:05:31Z","updated":"2026-10-10T06:42:59Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://eveglyphdesign.github.io/lenexa-city-center-commons/","topics":["civic-tech","community-map","eve-glyph-design","github-pages","leaflet","lenexa"],"demo":"https://eveglyphdesign.github.io/lenexa-city-center-commons/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:08.879Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:08.879Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:08.879Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:04:08.879Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A place for neighbors to compare notes on Lenexa City Center — restaurants, buildings, events, city services, everything.","A neutral, geofenced, publish-only community layer for the roughly 200 acres at the southwest quadrant of 87th Street Parkway and Renner Boulevard in Lenexa, Kansas — the Copaken Brooks City Center development. Residents, workers, students, and visitors can add a note about any building, business, venue, or civic feature inside the geofence. The map renders each tile's mood from the notes people actually wrote, so lived experience — not marketing — determines how a place looks.","Sibling project, same three-door pattern, same propose-only sweep, geographic instead of interview-claim scoped: ARK Peer Review Ledger."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/EVEglyphDesign/lenexa-city-center-commons/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ce6192084a98d930dd2c213e49470721b958887133cfb524bd75f44d04b9326c","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:08.952Z"},"overviewChecke